    "unavailableNote": "Rows whose url starts with one of unavailableHosts were published on a host that no longer answers (the Swarm-Official organisation is suspended). The pages render them as being re-published instead of a dead button, and tools/check_downloads.mjs lists them as paused. Repoint url and checksums to louisinthesubway/swarm-releases as each file is uploaded again; the SHA-256 stays the same.",
    "note": "Download metadata for the Ecosystem block on the home page, the /ecosystem hub and the app pages. Mainnet builds are the downloads; testnet builds are kept under \"channel\": \"testnet\" and rendered in their own labelled section. After updating entries, run python tools/build_ecosystem.py and verify with --check. Every available entry must have a working URL, version, SHA-256 and byte size.",
