    "walletUpdate": {
      "title": "Windows and Linux wallet update",
      "text": "Version 0.1.0-mainnet.9 preserves the last loaded transfer history after a failed read, keeps the original error in Technical details, and explains when the wallet needs restarting. Fully quit SWARM Wallet before installing, then reopen it. If a payment was in progress, check its status after reopening before sending it again.",
      "url": "https://github.com/louisinthesubway/swarm-releases/releases/tag/swarm-wallet-0.1.0-mainnet.9",
      "label": "Read the release notes"
    },
    "messengerNotice": "Unsigned first release — Windows SmartScreen and macOS Gatekeeper will warn. Check the SHA-256. Sign in with a new or existing 24-word phrase; there is no phone number."
